  description: 'During your Main Phase, you can Normal Summon 1 Level 1 LIGHT Tuner
    in addition to your Normal Summon/Set. (You can only gain this effect once per
    turn.) Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster you control; send 1 Normal
    Monster from your hand or Deck to the GY, and if you do, the targeted monster
    gains ATK/DEF equal to the Level of the monster sent to the GY x 100, until the
    end of this turn (even if this card leaves the field). You can banish this card
    from your GY; add 1 "Burst Stream of Destruction" from your Deck to your hand.'
